From: flange <flange@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dts: rk3566-orangepi-cm4: 修正 chosen.bootargs

两处修改：

1. 移除 root=PARTUUID=614e0000-0000
   该硬编码 root 通过 U-Boot 的 bootargs_add_dtb_dtbo + env_update 把
   extlinux APPEND 中的 root=PARTLABEL=... 覆盖掉，导致 flange normal /
   recovery 双 extlinux label 切换无效。删除后由 boot 分区的 extlinux 配置
   APPEND 自行决定 root，配合 U-Boot 在 extlinux.conf / recovery.conf 之间
   选择启动入口（与 tspi-rk3566 同款修复，原因一致）。

2. 追加 firmware_class.path=/lib/firmware
   作为板级合理默认，与 rootfs.extra_firmware 落点对齐。某些 driver（典型
   Rockchip OOT bcmdhd）默认 firmware 搜索路径若指向 Android /system/etc/...
   会找不到任何文件；显式声明 firmware_class.path 兜底解决。

其它 earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0xfe660000 / console=ttyFIQ0 / rw rootwait
保持不变作为板级合理默认。

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 	compatible = "rockchip,rk3566-orangepi-cm4", "rockchip,rk3566";
 	
 	chosen: chosen {
-		bootargs = "earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0xfe660000 console=ttyFIQ0 root=PARTUUID=614e0000-0000 rw rootwait";
+		bootargs = "earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0xfe660000 console=ttyFIQ0 rw rootwait firmware_class.path=/lib/firmware";
 	};
 	
 	/* labeled +12v in schematic */
